<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:">
<title>Apinata Demo</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light dark;
  --bg: #ffffff;
  --fg: #1f2328;
  --muted: #59636e;
  --line: #d1d9e0;
  --panel: #f6f8fa;
  --link: #0969da;
  --get: #1a7f37;
  --post: #9a6700;
  --put: #0969da;
  --patch: #8250df;
  --delete: #cf222e;
  --head: #1b7c83;
  --other: #59636e;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #0d1117;
    --fg: #e6edf3;
    --muted: #9198a1;
    --line: #3d444d;
    --panel: #151b23;
    --link: #4493f8;
    --get: #3fb950;
    --post: #d29922;
    --put: #4493f8;
    --patch: #ab7df8;
    --delete: #f85149;
    --head: #39c5cf;
    --other: #9198a1;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 960px;
  padding: 24px 16px 48px;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
}
a { color: var(--link); }
h1, h2, h3, h4 { line-height: 1.25; margin: 1.5em 0 0.5em; }
header h1 { margin-top: 0; }
nav { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 16px; background: var(--panel); }
nav h2 { margin-top: 0.5em; font-size: 1em; }
nav ul { padding-left: 1.25em; }
section, article { margin-top: 1.5em; }
article { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.5em; }
code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace; font-size: 0.9em; }
pre { overflow-x: auto; padding: 12px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; }
.url { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.docs { color: var(--fg); }
.note, caption { color: var(--muted); }
caption { text-align: left; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 0; }
table { display: block; overflow-x: auto; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 8px 0; max-width: 100%; }
th, td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
th { background: var(--panel); }
tr.disabled td { opacity: 0.55; }
.tag { margin-left: 6px; padding: 0 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--muted); }
.method { display: inline-block; min-width: 4.5em; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff; font: 600 0.8em ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; text-align: center; background: var(--other); }
.m-get { background: var(--get); }
.m-post { background: var(--post); }
.m-put { background: var(--put); }
.m-patch { background: var(--patch); }
.m-delete { background: var(--delete); }
.m-head, .m-options, .m-trace { background: var(--head); }
.m-other { background: var(--other); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Apinata Demo</h1>
<div class="docs">
<p>A small tour of Apinata.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Posts</strong> and <strong>Users</strong> call <a href="https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com">JSONPlaceholder</a>, a free fake REST API.</li>
<li><strong>Media</strong> calls <a href="https://httpbin.org">httpbin</a> for responses that are not JSON.</li>
<li><strong>Auth</strong> shows digest, NTLM, AWS Sig v4 signing and an OAuth 1.0 signature httpbin echoes.</li>
</ul>
<p>Sending a request needs network access.</p>
</div>
</header>
<nav>
<h2>Contents</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="#f-1">Posts</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#r-1-1"><span class="method m-get">GET</span> List posts</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-1-2"><span class="method m-get">GET</span> Get post</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-1-3"><span class="method m-post">POST</span> Create post</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-1-4"><span class="method m-put">PUT</span> Replace post</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-1-5"><span class="method m-patch">PATCH</span> Edit post title</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-1-6"><span class="method m-delete">DELETE</span> Delete post</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#f-2">Users</a>
<ul>
