<li><a href="#r-4-2"><span class="method m-get">GET</span> SigV4 example</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-4-3"><span class="method m-get">GET</span> OAuth 1.0 example</a></li>
<li><a href="#r-4-4"><span class="method m-get">GET</span> NTLM example</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
