<main>
<section id="f-1">
<h2>Posts</h2>
<article id="r-1-1">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> List posts</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/posts?_limit=5</code></p>
<table>
<caption>Query params</caption>
<thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>_limit</td><td>5</td><td></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-1-2">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> Get post</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/posts/:id</code></p>
<div class="docs">
<p>Fetches the post named by the <code>postId</code> collection variable and keeps its title as <code>postTitle</code>.</p>
</div>
<table>
<caption>Path params</caption>
<thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>id</td><td>{{postId}}</td><td></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-1-3">
<h3><span class="method m-post">POST</span> Create post</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/posts</code></p>
<table>
<caption>Headers</caption>
<thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Content-Type</td><td>application/json</td><td></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="part">Body (json)</p>
<pre>{
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Hello from Apinata&quot;,
  &quot;body&quot;: &quot;A demo post.&quot;,
  &quot;userId&quot;: 1
}</pre>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-1-4">
<h3><span class="method m-put">PUT</span> Replace post</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/posts/1</code></p>
<p class="part">Body (json)</p>
<pre>{
  &quot;id&quot;: 1,
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Replaced&quot;,
  &quot;body&quot;: &quot;A replaced post.&quot;,
  &quot;userId&quot;: 1
}</pre>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-1-5">
<h3><span class="method m-patch">PATCH</span> Edit post title</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/posts/1</code></p>
<p class="part">Body (json)</p>
<pre>{
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Edited&quot;
}</pre>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-1-6">
<h3><span class="method m-delete">DELETE</span> Delete post</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/posts/1</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
</section>
<section id="f-2">
<h2>Users</h2>
<article id="r-2-1">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> List users</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/users</code></p>
<table>
<caption>Headers</caption>
<thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Accept</td><td>application/json</td><td></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-2-2">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> Get user</h3>
<p class="url"><code>{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}</code></p>
<div class="docs">
<p>Fetches the user named by <code>userId</code>. Run it with <code>examples/demo-data/users.csv</code> as the data file to fetch users 1 to 3, one per iteration.</p>
</div>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
</section>
<section id="f-3">
<h2>Media</h2>
<div class="docs">
<h2>Media</h2>
<p>Responses that are not JSON:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Get XML</strong> returns an XML document, shown re-indented and highlighted.</li>
<li><strong>Get PNG</strong> returns a PNG image, shown as a preview with its size and dimensions.</li>
</ol>
</div>
<article id="r-3-1">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> Get XML</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://httpbin.org/xml</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
<article id="r-3-2">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> Get PNG</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://httpbin.org/image/png</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
</section>
<section id="f-4">
<h2>Auth</h2>
<article id="r-4-1">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> Digest example</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://httpbin.org/digest-auth/auth/user/passwd</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: Digest</p>
</article>
<article id="r-4-2">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> SigV4 example</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://example.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: AWS Signature v4</p>
</article>
<article id="r-4-3">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> OAuth 1.0 example</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://httpbin.org/get</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: OAuth 1.0</p>
</article>
<article id="r-4-4">
<h3><span class="method m-get">GET</span> NTLM example</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://httpbin.org/get</code></p>
<p class="auth">Auth: NTLM</p>
</article>
</section>
<section id="f-5">
<h2>GraphQL</h2>
<article id="r-5-1">
<h3><span class="method m-post">POST</span> Get user</h3>
<p class="url"><code>https://graphqlzero.almansi.me/api</code></p>
<p class="part">Body (graphql)</p>
<pre>query ($id: ID!) {
  user(id: $id) {
    id
    name
    email
  }
}</pre>
<p class="part">Variables</p>
<pre>{
  &quot;id&quot;: 1
}</pre>
<p class="auth">Auth: Inherited (No auth)</p>
</article>
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
